Spoilers a-comin' (well, none TOO major)

Firstly, you tried to write a scroll that simply didn't exist.  No scroll
named Identity exists in any version of Hack I've come across.  If you were
to write an Identify scroll, that'd work.
The entire trick to these scrolls, though, is that to write one, you must
have read one before the scribing.  IE:To write an identify (note, no letter
is capitalized, keep them all in lowercase), you must have read an identify
scroll prior to writing one yourself.
Secondly, Fountains are good for a variety of things, removing curses on
items (the water will glow), summoning water demons that grant wishes (but
beware, the ones that DON'T grant a wish are nasty to deal with at low
levels), curing small portions of hunger, and bestowing the see invisible
intrinsic.  Most of these come from drinking.  From dipping into the
fountain, you can still get the demon and the cursing (oh yeah, it does this
too) and uncursing, but they also can make an Excalibur, if you have the
right weapon and are of proper level.
So if you're in a dipping spree uncursing items, just keep doing so until
she dries up and move onto the next one... that is, if you can take a fight
from water mocassins and/or water demons and/or nymphs.



